{"hw":"ἐπαϊω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἐπαϊω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἐπαϊω</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">contr.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἐπᾴω</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HF</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">773</span> </span> (lyr.): <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor. 1</span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἐπήϊσα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.93</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.R.</span> </span> Il.cc.: (v. <span class=\"gk\">ἀΐω, εἰσαΐω</span>):—<b class=\"lex-tr\">give ear to,</b> <span class=\"gk\">θεῶν οὐδὲν ἐπαΐοντες</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Supp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">759</span> </span> (lyr.), cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> </span> l. c.; <b class=\"lex-tr\">hear,</b> <span class=\"gk\">τῆς φωνῆς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plu.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Brut.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">16</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">perceive, feel,</b> <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">τι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">75.15</span> </span>( v.l. ἐπάγοισιν ) <span class=\"gk\">; θεοὶ ἔναιμοί τε καὶ σαρκώδεες καὶ ἐπαΐοντες σιδηρίων</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.29</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δηγμάτων</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-au